OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOasis 2027: Knebworth return
OL,4,Aconfirmed as well as Manchester and
OL,5,AGlasgow gigs
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey will also play a 11-night
OL,8,Fresidency at the home of their beloved
OL,9,FManchester City in June, after kicking
OL,10,Foff the tour with five gigs at
OL,11,FGlasgow's Celtic Park in May.
OL,13,FThe announcement dropped on Monday
OL,14,Fafternoon alongside a new trailer and
OL,15,Fphoto of the band. "Start the
OL,16,Fcelebrations!" said a message on the
OL,17,Fband's social media.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
